#. translators: [user-name], [reviewer-name], [review-link] and [site-name] are tokens replaced at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-general-tab.php:16
msgid ""
"Hello [user-name],\n"
"\n"
"We hope this message finds you well.\n"
"\n"
"We are pleased to inform you that [reviewer-name] has recently submitted a "
"review on your profile. To view the full review and respond, please click on "
"the link below:\n"
"\n"
"[review-link]\n"
"\n"
"We appreciate your engagement in our community and value your "
"contributions.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"The [site-name] Team"
msgstr ""
"Hallo [user-name],\n"
"\n"
"Wir hoffen, dass es dir gut geht.\n"
"\n"
"Wir freuen uns, dir mitteilen zu können, dass [reviewer-name] eine Bewertung "
"auf deinem Profil eingereicht hat. Um die vollständige Bewertung einzusehen "
"und zu antworten, klicke bitte auf den untenstehenden Link:\n"
"\n"
"[review-link]\n"
"\n"
"Wir schätzen dein Engagement in unserer Gemeinschaft und deine Beiträge.\n"
"\n"
"Beste Grüße,\n"
"Das [site-name] Team"

#. translators: [site-admin], [site-name] and [review-aproval-link] are tokens replaced at send time - keep them verbatim.
#: admin/tab-templates/bupr-setting-general-tab.php:33
