"Hello [site-admin],\n"
"\n"
"Greetings!\n"
"\n"
"You have received a new review on [site-name] that is pending approval. To "
"review and approve the submission, please click on the link below:\n"
"\n"
"[review-aproval-link]\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for helping us maintain a vibrant and engaged community.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards,\n"
"The [site-name] Team"
msgstr ""
"Hallo [site-admin],\n"
"\n"
"Grüße!\n"
"\n"
"Du hast eine neue Bewertung auf [site-name] erhalten, die zur Genehmigung "
"aussteht. Um die Einsendung zu überprüfen und genehmigen zu können, klicke "
